OL,3,GNEWSAResidents upset over plans to
OL,4,Ademolish garages
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have said council proposals
OL,7,Fto knock down a garage block for social
OL,8,Fhousing has caused upset over a lack of
OL,9,Fconsultation and parking concerns.
OL,11,FAffected tenants of the garages in
OL,12,FByrness Close in Kenton, Newcastle,
OL,13,Fsaid they were informed of the plans
OL,14,Flast month and a notice has since gone
OL,15,Fup saying demolition work could start
OL,16,Fin January.
OL,18,FAlan Taylor, whose family garage is
OL,19,Faffected, said it was "disappointing"
OL,20,Fthere had been no consultation on the
OL,21,Fdemolition and more housing would make
OL,22,Fthe estate "crammed".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
