OL,3,GNEWSAResidents upset over plans to
OL,4,Ademolish garages
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewcastle City Council said it was "too
OL,7,Fsoon" to confirm if any homes would be
OL,8,Fbuilt and a consultation would help
OL,9,Finform "what, if anything, is taken
OL,10,Fforward".
